|YK0================================================================
                              |GKBMONKPOWERS COMMAND
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'A wise man never loses anything, if he has himself.'|WKO - |RKBMichel
de Montaigne|YK0

This command provides a list of all current powers that the
Monk can use. It will only show those powers that you
have attained, amd those you hope to have. It provides the
syntax, and costs to use the powers.

|YKO================================================================
